--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -7,3 +7,12 @@ A small expense ledger. Entries live in a JSON file (`--data` or `$LEDGER_DATA`)
     python -m ledger report --by month
 
 Tests: `python -m unittest discover -s tests`.
+
+To add a monthly series, supply its start date and inclusive end date:
+
+    python -m ledger add 2026-01-31 12.50 food "monthly lunch" --repeat monthly --until 2026-04-30
+
+Each month uses the start day, or the last day of a shorter month. Listing and
+both reports include each occurrence. The JSON file stores one record for the
+series with `repeat` and `until` fields, rather than storing generated entries;
+existing one-time records retain their ordinary format.
